Package: taos-tools
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: jaylfc <jaylfc25@gmail.com>
Priority: optional
Section: utils
Depends: grim, fbcat
Description: taOS command line tools
 taos-screenshot captures what is on the machine's screen to a PNG: the
 Wayland session (sway) with grim when one is running, else the text console
 framebuffer. Useful for remote support and for agents that need to see the
 screen.
